        <h3>About the author</h3>
        <p><p><strong>Michael Webb</strong> began his baseball fandom in 1978, which was a really great year to be a Boston Red Sox fan. Most of it, anyway. He now follows the Sox in South Jersey with his patient wife and son.</p>
</p>
